{
    "background_story": "Mila's life seemed perfect - a beautiful home, a loving partner, and a successful career as a boutique owner. But behind the fa\u00e7ade, she struggled with a dark secret: kleptomania. As a teenager, she had started shoplifting as a thrill-seeking activity, but it soon spiralled into an uncontrollable compulsion. Despite her best efforts to stop, Mila found herself stealing small items from her own store, as well as from friends' homes and public places. The guilt and shame consumed her, causing her to lead a double life. One day, she was caught by her business partner, who instead of turning her in, offered to help her seek professional help. With therapy and support, Mila began to confront her addiction and work towards recovery. It was a long, difficult journey, but she was determined to overcome her kleptomania and rebuild her life with honesty and integrity.",
